---@field enableTextDetectionConfidenceScore? boolean By default, Cloud Vision API only includes confidence score for DOCUMENT_TEXT_DETECTION result. Set the flag to true to include confidence score for TEXT_DETECTION as well.
---@field advancedOcrOptions? gcp.vision_v1.StringList A list of advanced OCR options to further fine-tune OCR behavior. Current valid values are: - `legacy_layout`: a heuristics layout detection algorithm, which serves as an alternative to the current ML-based layout detection algorithm. Customers can choose the best suitable layout algorithm based on their situation.

---Additional information detected on the structural component.
---@class gcp.vision_v1.TextProperty
---@field detectedLanguages? gcp.vision_v1.DetectedLanguageList A list of detected languages together with confidence.
---@field detectedBreak? gcp.vision_v1.DetectedBreak Detected start or end of a text segment.

---A vertex represents a 2D point in the image. NOTE: the vertex coordinates are in the same scale as the original image.
---@class gcp.vision_v1.Vertex
---@field x? number X coordinate.
---@field y? number Y coordinate.

---@alias gcp.vision_v1.VertexList gcp.vision_v1.Vertex[]

---A single symbol representation.
---@class gcp.vision_v1.Vision_Symbol
---@field text? string The actual UTF-8 representation of the symbol.
---@field boundingBox? gcp.vision_v1.BoundingPoly The bounding box for the symbol. The vertices are in the order of top-left, top-right, bottom-right, bottom-left. When a rotation of the bounding box is detected the rotation is represented as around the top-left corner as defined when the text is read in the 'natural' orientation. For example: * when the text is horizontal it might look like: 0----1 | | 3----2 * when it's rotated 180 degrees around the top-left corner it becomes: 2----3 | | 1----0 and the vertex order will still be (0, 1, 2, 3).
---@field confidence? number Confidence of the OCR results for the symbol. Range [0, 1].
---@field property? gcp.vision_v1.TextProperty Additional information detected for the symbol.

---@alias gcp.vision_v1.Vision_SymbolList gcp.vision_v1.Vision_Symbol[]

